<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Italian first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Bologna 0 Fiorentina 2 (Batistuta 44, De Marchi 80 - own-goal).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-1. Attendance: 80,000</p>
<p>Lazio 2 (Nedved 22, Signori 50) Cagliari 1 (Banchelli 76). 1-0.</p>
<p>35,000</p>
<p>Milan 3 (Weah 40 and 58, Baggio 77) Napoli 1 (Cruz 61). 1-0.</p>
<p>55,000</p>
<p>Parma 1 (Chiesa 90) Perugia 2 (Giunti 21, Gautieri 25). 0-2.</p>
<p>21,500</p>
<p>Piacenza 3 (Luiso 23 and 75, Di Francesco 87) Reggiana 0. 1-0.</p>
<p>10,000</p>
<p>Sampdoria 2 (Jacopino 10, Veron 27) Atalanta 0. 2-0. 22,000</p>
<p>Udinese 1 (Poggi 71) Vicenza 1 (Maini 90). 0-0. 17,000</p>
<p>Verona 2 (Giunta 30, Orlandini 80) Roma 1 (Marco Delvecchio</p>
<p>51). 1-0. 20,000</p>
<p>Add first division summaries: Juventus 2 (Jugovic 40, Zidane 62) Inter 0. 1-0. 40,000</p>
